        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with cluster caltrops makes D6 Hammer of Wrath attacks instead of just one. These are resolved at Strength 6 and have the Rending special rule. </characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
