    <selectionEntry id="65a2-bc9f-67ca-0a7f-32f57" name="Formation: Storm of Blades" page="53" hidden="false" collective="false" type="unit">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="66d9-6508-d74e-fe0d-32f57" name="Restrictions (Storm of Blades)" page="53" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>
- All Archons, Kabalite Warriors, and Kabalite Trueborn units in the formation must begin the game embarked upon Dedicated Transports.
- All Raiders in the formation must have the enhanced aethersails upgrade.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c025-4148-6807-b30d-32f57" name="Skybound (Storm of Blades)" page="53" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Units from this battle formation may not voluntarily disembark or Go to Ground. Any unit that disembarks, for any reason, immediately loses a pain token. If it has no pain tokens, it instead takes a Pinning test. At the beginning of each Dark Eldar Shooting phase, a unit from this formation may choose to have the Skyfire special rule for the duration of that phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3469-8b9a-15b1-29ed-32f57" name="Storm of Blades (Storm of Blades)" page="53" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>Raiders from this formation, and units embarked on them, may shoot in the same turn they use the bonus move from their enhanced aethersails. They may then move Flat Out as if they had not shot that turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="bde6-db3c-634f-76dd-32f57" name="Storm Of Blades - At Least 3 Units Required" page="53" hidden="false" collective="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="3.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="728d-a943-feff-855c-32f57" type="min" />
